msgid "CubePilot CubeNode ETH"
msgstr "CubePilot CubeNode ETH"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:11
#: 110cb4bda98145768537075a608da0d9 49ab1514b02c49239d7d32b5d021efe5
#: f3819414ae7a4449a4956f14f713fd5b f95e20a7680f456e8a879fc036149c4b
#: fbff5a9d46b74895b61fc8f793c3210c
msgid ""
"The `CubePilot CubeNode ETH <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/cubenode/cubenode-eth>`__ ethernet adapter allows STM32 H7 autopilots"
" without built-in ethernet support to connect to ethernet peripherals.  This"
" is often used in combination with a `CubeLAN 8 Port Switch "
"<https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__"
msgstr ""
"`CubePilot CubeNode ETH <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/cubenode/cubenode-eth>`__ 以太网适配器，可让没有内置以太网支持的 STM32 H7 飞控连接以太网外设。通常与 "
"`CubeLAN 8 口交换机 <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__ 配合使用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:13
