"`CubeNode ETH 可从 CubePilot 经销商购买 "
"<https://www.cubepilot.org/#/reseller/list>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:20
#: 049eee23947d4a249e97e9d41b77906a 89a80855d4ff4991b9db2814899c10d3
#: defb96e0aec1471c9926a5bb9acc92f0 e632c0e16be3497baf580c9088a5c03e
#: f89f9f6f0fc942d6a6dc718290719f09
msgid ""
"Optionally the `CubeLAN 8 Port Switch <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__ may be useful to connect multiple "
"devices via Ethernet"
msgstr ""
"可选的 `CubeLAN 8 口交换机 <https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-"
"guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__ 可用于通过以太网连接多个设备"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:23
#: 22a7eedc30844f958e493de7d10a6b8c 4f0aa2794fd84b56bedf9257a1dc9d66
#: 674ac8e317b64b59bcc5cfe470ab34f2 e0b4da6a49484c5fa0582a10341408a5
#: ebf921711d154ef390ec21560fb46437
msgid "Connecting to the Autopilot"
msgstr "连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:29
#: 14647fdb1438485bb0b4e4847b6a75a7 42a011d017d4495a841d8557af369427
#: 6be71ca675ed4eff82cfae5f199f42c8 eab53658e33e49a28c878a57136c2fdc
#: f5e3a0784dbb4413a0226afa8fbd81ec
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's serial ports to the CubeNodeETH's UART port. "
"For optimum performance the autopilot's serial port should support flow "
"control which normally means using Serial1 or Serial2.  In the image above "
"Serial2 is used."
msgstr ""
"将飞控的一个串行端口连接到 CubeNodeETH 的 UART 端口。为获得最佳性能，飞控的串行端口应支持流控制，通常使用 Serial1 或 "
"Serial2。上图中使用的是 Serial2。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:31
#: 0a548088f0444eff924be5b91894eeec 5b8541625d8a4c0f86fe978b82fdbf9c
#: a8789e8e95d44bb2aa052d21821fc05c b9d79acd809a4427b1db1e7b34e77a2a
#: bcd5c21e6b5841b59280a963dc394e62
msgid ""
"Connect one of the autopilot's CAN ports to the CubeNodeETH's CAN port.  "
"This connection is only used to configure the device and so it maybe removed"
" after the configuration is completed.  In the image above the autopilot's "
"CAN1 is used."
msgstr ""
"将飞控的一个 CAN 端口连接到 CubeNodeETH 的 CAN 端口。此连接仅用于配置设备，配置完成后可以断开。上图中使用的是飞控的 CAN1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:33
#: 35be2b51f6c9486d8d028f035f293390 3ddc395d347f49a3af355203cda8dbce
#: 5e8a62b344c7455e9402254d6684910b 9b44666d61ac4a909d019edda1408fc1
#: a634a07800a34ae1a2546e342908fbf4
msgid ""
"While difficult to see in the image above, the CubeNodeETH has a 5-pin "
"ethernet connector with the same pin layout as the `CubeLAN 8 Port Switch "
"<https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__"
msgstr ""
"虽然在上图中难以看清，CubeNodeETH 有一个 5 针以太网接口，与 `CubeLAN 8 口交换机 "
"<https://docs.cubepilot.org/user-guides/switch/cubelan-8-port-switch>`__ "
"引脚布局相同"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:39
#: 5bb148e6c0c5403a90b15dda71c9ce61 8740eab7dcc04067bdf59759201072a9
#: 8e2f8c2318884e3c9b082487c28fefba d9671a3b798a4ab98d05e992b62e1e15
#: d9f91248b8994f09b4b8f6805475bd5f
msgid "The general rule when connecting ethernet devices is:"
msgstr "连接以太网设备的一般规则是："

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:41
#: 0b58c82073e245c19bc007df071c07e7 1b7fb0643bb54f9ba6c7c5ae1930f32a
#: 7976315ee7ef43d3b98d7ef3c4300284 971e6c8e1b674ccf9f39c3718ff6c7a4
#: ba98006a88004c8abacbdc819a47ee91
msgid ""
"When connecting a device to a switch the pins should be connected straight "
"through (e.g. RX+ to RX+, RX- to RX-, TX+ to TX+, TX- to TX-)"
msgstr "将设备连接到交换机时，引脚应直通连接（例如 RX+ 接 RX+，RX- 接 RX-，TX+ 接 TX+，TX- 接 TX-）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:42
#: 545748e28a5147e2801e47d09b741162 61560c4170074b12afe46dc2bff84f7d
#: 934746617c7f44a6863527af6942aff6 c0df993d8d924e72897e93e58a58892b
#: f4a63e3bf80c4a1ba1b64a94937e9da7
msgid ""
"When connecting a device to a device the pins should be crossed (e.g. RX+ to"
" TX+, RX- to TX-, TX+ to RX+, TX- to RX-)"
msgstr "将设备连接到设备时，引脚应交叉连接（例如 RX+ 接 TX+，RX- 接 TX-，TX+ 接 RX+，TX- 接 RX-）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:45
#: 024ea8acc47148ee939318cce4318bcb 4170ae9add2649c98d893ebef8fc835d
#: 4499a9723b6f446a9ae4e8fc951fbc7b 8225cd17693e4701a99e0eecc8a680e3
#: d12b1b077e7141ba8d423329c761548a
msgid "Install ArduPilot with PPP Support"
msgstr "安装支持 PPP 的 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:47
#: 145852c85d0149a3b4e694944c35d46c 22b16cb5524e4b63b2368270d072ba37
#: b1118f40f535420187180ecb9b19b46e e00c13b7617347f8a485ad32149fc54f
#: e660313f99e84442b0c07052ade319ff
msgid ""
"`PPP <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point-to-"
"Point_Protocol_over_Ethernet>`__ allows an autopilot to communicate over "
"Ethernet using a serial port but with the exception of the CubePilot "
"CubeOrangePlus, PPP is not included by default in the ArduPilot firmware."
msgstr ""
"`PPP <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Point-to-"
"Point_Protocol_over_Ethernet>`__ 允许飞控通过串行端口经以太网通信，但除 CubePilot "
"CubeOrangePlus 外，ArduPilot 固件默认不包含 PPP 支持。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:49
#: 64346a465a9d447b8ad3c6aae16c2481 796db93b2a074e9d9f8913be874aeb38
