#: c1355ba1ea9847faa251708dafeb196b
msgid ""
"Use the `Custom Firmware Build Server <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ to "
"build a firmware that includes PPP support"
msgstr "使用 `自定义固件构建服务器 <https://custom.ardupilot.org/>`__ 构建包含 PPP 支持的固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-cubepilot-cubenodeeth.rst:54
#: 189ef93e205949c9970637be0a3a5dc4 27885ef3c32e4ce0a0874808d2403feb
#: 4e1a264226b54145b42180bd8743072a 9018508cefdc4045abaa111ffe4b39ff
